{"vid":"UmiSMDVDWJI","source":"UmiSMDVDWJI.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":4,"txt":"So the question, how do I start a career"},{"t":6,"txt":"transition in a resume?"},{"t":7,"txt":"So I'm going to take that from a"},{"t":8,"txt":"perspective of you're using a resume"},{"t":10.4,"txt":"in the process of career transitioning."},{"t":12.6,"txt":"Right. So hiring managers looking at it"},{"t":14.6,"txt":"and saying, hey, you know, you're applying"},{"t":15.9,"txt":"to a job with a different title."},{"t":17,"txt":"You haven't done this work in the past."},{"t":19.6,"txt":"Great question. When that comes up all the"},{"t":21.4,"txt":"time, I would say it's, it's that"},{"t":23.9,"txt":"builds strength on strength principle and"},{"t":26,"txt":"leverage transferable experiences."},{"t":28.3,"txt":"So prior to ever getting to the point"},{"t":30,"txt":"where there's a hiring manager looking at"},{"t":31.8,"txt":"your resume, I would say you're"},{"t":34.1,"txt":"going to know that job description that"},{"t":35.9,"txt":"they're hiring for it. You're going to"},{"t":37,"txt":"know the things on the qualifications list"},{"t":39,"txt":"or the experiences list that you can do"},{"t":41.3,"txt":"and have done."},{"t":42.4,"txt":"And that's exactly how I answer that"},{"t":43.7,"txt":"question. Right, is, I would even"},{"t":45.9,"txt":"use myself as an example that I"},{"t":47.9,"txt":"transitioned from, you know, a senior"},{"t":50,"txt":"engineering manager at an aerospace"},{"t":51.7,"txt":"company to a senior program manager in a"},{"t":53.8,"txt":"tech company, completely different spaces,"},{"t":56.3,"txt":"but justified my reasons"},{"t":58.4,"txt":"to be there based off of like, hey, I've"},{"t":60.2,"txt":"done all this stuff on your qualifications"},{"t":62.3,"txt":"list, right? I've run businesses, I've"},{"t":64.3,"txt":"built buildings, I've hired people,"},{"t":66.7,"txt":"I've, you know, led projects and solve"},{"t":68.7,"txt":"problems in these very similar ways."},{"t":70.5,"txt":"The industries are different, but I have"},{"t":72.4,"txt":"the skills you're looking for, right."},{"t":73.7,"txt":"And they're right on your job description."},{"t":75.6,"txt":"By the way, here's a bunch of results"},{"t":77.8,"txt":"that I delivered when I did these things."},{"t":80.7,"txt":"That's exactly how I would frame up the"},{"t":82,"txt":"resume. Right? Is have them speak to those"},{"t":84,"txt":"qualifications that that are transferable,"},{"t":86.5,"txt":"that you've done, and then you've got"},{"t":88.2,"txt":"experience doing."},{"t":89.6,"txt":"Any tips about writing a resume"},{"t":92,"txt":"or profile if you're changing careers?"},{"t":96.4,"txt":"Yes."},{"t":97.5,"txt":"The biggest thing about and this"},{"t":99.7,"txt":"is I've helped people, to do"},{"t":101.9,"txt":"this successfully switch from one"},{"t":104.2,"txt":"type of career to another type of career."},{"t":106.2,"txt":"The biggest thing is understanding"},{"t":108.7,"txt":"what experience is, what skills,"},{"t":111.1,"txt":"what qualifications, what tasks that"},{"t":113.3,"txt":"you've performed that even though"},{"t":115.7,"txt":"it's a it's from a completely different"},{"t":117.7,"txt":"job, completely different career."},{"t":119.4,"txt":"If that new job that you want to apply"},{"t":121.7,"txt":"for, that type of career that you want to"},{"t":122.8,"txt":"apply for still requires those basic"},{"t":125.3,"txt":"types of tasks and responsibilities,"},{"t":127.9,"txt":"then make sure you leverage those and"},{"t":130.5,"txt":"use the language that the new"},{"t":132.7,"txt":"job that you're trying to apply for uses"},{"t":135.7,"txt":"and and and then, you"},{"t":138,"txt":"know, sort of like just bring that over,"},{"t":140,"txt":"transfer that over, for the resume."},{"t":144,"txt":"Thanks for watching."},{"t":145,"txt":"Some great advice there."},{"t":146.7,"txt":"Hope you found it useful and informative."},{"t":149.4,"txt":"If you're looking fo